    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Finding Halfmoon</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra and Adora have been together for over a year now. Theyâ€™re engaged and are living their best life in Brightmoon. Everything seems perfectâ€¦ almost perfect. After Entrapta discovers some mysterious ruins and presents her findings to her friends, Catra begins to experience strange visions, visions that appear all too familiar to her. She makes it her secret mission to find out what they mean. Whilst searching for answers, Catra discovers some more information about her past before the Horde and comes across those she never imagined existed.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
